eye-contact-co-processing-at-the-speed-of-light-lines-8 : List (List Word)
eye-contact-co-processing-at-the-speed-of-light-lines-8 = cons "## 5. What Eye Contact Reveals" (cons "" (cons "Because optical coupling combines high spatial bandwidth with minimal abstraction loss, mutual gaze transmits five parallel physical correlates of internal information processing:" (cons "" (cons "- **Gaze direction and joint attention:** Where a person looks exposes their active attentional sampling—making their observation focus externally readable and enabling zero-overhead joint attention." (cons "- **Pupil dynamics:** Governed by the autonomic nervous system (locus coeruleus–norepinephrine and Edinger–Westphal nuclei), pupil dilation tracks arousal, cognitive load, surprise, and salience directly." (cons "- **Periocular micro-expressions:** Involuntary muscular contractions around the eyes (*orbicularis oculi*, *corrugator supercilii*) unfold on a 40–200 ms timescale, ahead of conscious cortical suppression (e.g., the Duchenne smile recruiting *orbicularis oculi* versus a posed lower-face smile)." (cons "- **Saccades and fixation patterns:** Rapid eye movements expose active information-gathering priorities in real time." (cons "- **Binocular vergence:** The convergence angle between the eyes reveals focal depth—whether the other person is actively attending to you or looking through you." (cons "" (cons "These are not arbitrary social symbols; they are direct physical manifestations of ongoing neural computation." (cons "" nil)))))))))))
